{"frozen_reasoning_spans":[{"end":167,"id":"S001","sha256":"f6b753a913dd4a75606fd660baec84e17ce6f86c1a5590e5638876d59a63faa7","start":0,"text":"To solve the equation |x - 5| + |x - 7| = 16, we consider the critical points where the expressions inside the absolute values change signs, which are x = 5 and x = 7."},{"end":259,"id":"S002","sha256":"32fbd21d6eb5cefe32ddec5a915ddc22234915485eec4d2a9cfe8f0437ad1846","start":168,"text":"These points divide the real number line into three intervals: (-\u221e, 5), [5, 7], and (7, \u221e)."},{"end":296,"id":"S003","sha256":"074e90e74c8ac19a7d89dafc58de6260cfe998ad58dc0556d665510aa322188a","start":260,"text":"We analyze each interval separately."},{"end":344,"id":"S004","sha256":"0af124c541fdd133aaa9177e0ad4f69d39d104a3b8635808d78890314e5bb1a8","start":297,"text":"For x < 5, |x - 5| = 5 - x and |x - 7| = 7 - x."},{"end":429,"id":"S005","sha256":"f0246ec38c0a54d1ce0130efd93caeb672ba51ca899c8cc779bbf82bde30082e","start":345,"text":"Thus, the equation becomes (5 - x) + (7 - x) = 16, which simplifies to 12 - 2x = 16."},{"end":457,"id":"S006","sha256":"786b887ca1c080cab6827be501a54aa4b105779fc2d96d1ddfec7a8644342aa6","start":430,"text":"Solving for x gives x = -2."},{"end":509,"id":"S007","sha256":"44af7e6543cf196dc6b7e702fc8f675fce523ba95256afc3b820c55676ed6dde","start":458,"text":"For 5 \u2264 x \u2264 7, |x - 5| = x - 5 and |x - 7| = 7 - x."},{"end":588,"id":"S008","sha256":"cea2845505d3ed6ab0c2d1e92e43ea8dfcffd92ac7dd94d41e9d18c393d44f15","start":510,"text":"Thus, the equation becomes (x - 5) + (7 - x) = 16, which simplifies to 2 = 16."},{"end":657,"id":"S009","sha256":"dfabe04c6ac5ad2e78240f0460c0ffa89cb814fbb2fabb5db4a8db9b1d7fda69","start":589,"text":"This is a contradiction, so there are no solutions in this interval."},{"end":705,"id":"S010","sha256":"52fc87c9330a32af2f66fce97f83b5527bb9dbb35218a82862014f57af0ebd50","start":658,"text":"For x > 7, |x - 5| = x - 5 and |x - 7| = x - 7."},{"end":790,"id":"S011","sha256":"067822c4557440d68fca68bdda43cd459f5c7de202e5aa867db3b5190f88bb6b","start":706,"text":"Thus, the equation becomes (x - 5) + (x - 7) = 16, which simplifies to 2x - 12 = 16."},{"end":818,"id":"S012","sha256":"7c18ee7ac18bc9456344c97ac8b81fd7f3f465bff85c99f56b118877e4758e8f","start":791,"text":"Solving for x gives x = 14."},{"end":866,"id":"S013","sha256":"fc4f36c4e0c11ab25a72f89aed717de9baabf83382a82ca88feda0190939cc4b","start":819,"text":"Therefore, the solutions are x = -2 and x = 14."},{"end":896,"id":"S014","sha256":"e07e595355d8d2c8004298694710090ab2734cd004b0e046193da77c2f31b56c","start":867,"text":"The largest value of x is 14."}],"problem":"Solve for all real values of x: |x - 5| + |x - 7| = 16. Report the largest value of x that satisfies the equation.","problem_id":"cw1-d391713f6617","span_projection_version":"action-census-reasoning-span-projection-v1"}

